            "reviewBody": "I made this using the Stash Double Spice Chai tea, I decreased the amount of honey which sweetened it enough for me, and I whipped some low-fat milk in the blender, but I think that whole milk would have been better.",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-06T15:25:52.373Z"
